Short:        MUI 3.8 custom classes with a modern flat look
Author:       spotUP
Uploader:     spotUP
Type:         dev/mui
Version:      1.0
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.0.0
Requires:     MUI 3.8
URL:          https://github.com/spotUP/selecta
Replaces:     -

UP-MCC is a package of eleven MUI 3.8 custom classes (UP-Button, UP-Text, UP-Panel,
UP-Tabs, UP-Balance, UP-Slider, UP-Progress, UP-Cycle, UP-Field, UP-Scroller, UP-List),
a preferences class (UP-MCC.mcp), the support library up-mcc.library, the Inter font,
dark and light theme files, programmer headers, AutoDoc files and a demonstration
program with its source.

Install with the Installer script Install-UP-MCC. The classes use ttengine.library for
anti-aliased text when it is installed (optional, not included); without it they draw
plain text.

Licence: MIT for the package code. Lucide icons: ISC. Inter font: SIL Open Font License 1.1.
Source: https://github.com/spotUP/selecta
